      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Other users might mistake someone for being muted, which could easily cause misunderstandings or issues, so it’d be great if this could be improved.\n\nIt would really help to have some kind of visual indicator?like a dedicated icon?showing that the “Audio From Camera” feature is active.\n\n(For example, if the camera is placed far away, the person might not notice when someone’s trying to talk to them.)\n\nJust for reference:\n\n・The first photo shows what other users see when someone is muted.\n\n・The second photo shows what it looks like when the “Audio From Camera” feature is being used.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
